e tables on a disadvantageous situation!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157320/extras/1e7182c7463e9c267bf0d8371457ee8a.poster.avif?t=1772414468\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157320/extras/1e7182c7463e9c267bf0d8371457ee8a.webm?t=1772414468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157320/extras/1e7182c7463e9c267bf0d8371457ee8a.mp4?t=1772414468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >8 Mages... and more!</h2>Mages specializing in different elements have come together to battle for the top spot. Each mage has an element they focus on, and they use unique magic based on that element. Remember, if you defeat an opposing mage, you can make his unique magic your own! What will happen when you've defeated them all?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157320/extras/9e3c3960a46719285b4b48aec621df19.poster.avif?t=1772414468\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157320/extras/9e3c3960a46719285b4b48aec621df19.webm?t=1772414468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157320/extras/9e3c3960a46719285b4b48aec621df19.mp4?t=1772414468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A free-roaming map.</h2>The game takes place on a procedurally generated, grid-based map. Explore, battle, merchant, rest, whatever you want and reap the benefits!","developers":["ooze"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://share